          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നടപ്പാത — naṭappāta — \"a footpath; a pavement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കുട്ടികൾ നടപ്പാതയിലൂടെ പള്ളിക്കൂടത്തിലേക്ക് നടന്നു. kuṭṭikaḷ naṭappātayilūṭe paḷḷikkūṭattilēkkŭ naṭannu. The children walked to school along the footpath."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built from നട, walking, the stem of നടക്കുക, and പാത, a road."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നടപ്പാത (naṭappāta) is a Malayalam compound built from നട, a walk, from the native root of നടക്കുക (DEDR 3582), and പാത, a road."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
